WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.168 --> 00:00:02.408
[Conan] Let's face it, it is impossible to do justice

2
00:00:02.408 --> 00:00:04.568
in 40 minutes to the incredibly complex

3
00:00:04.568 --> 00:00:06.608
and polarizing country of Israel.

4
00:00:06.608 --> 00:00:08.179
But I did accomplish my goal,

5
00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:10.388
which was to make friends wherever I went.

6
00:00:10.388 --> 00:00:12.869
Negotiations at a government level are great,

7
00:00:12.869 --> 00:00:14.588
but until people of different backgrounds

8
00:00:14.588 --> 00:00:17.175
can barbecue next to each other in the same park,

9
00:00:17.175 --> 00:00:19.525
and their kids can kick the same soccer ball,

10
00:00:19.525 --> 00:00:22.545
you will not have peace at a molecular level.

11
00:00:22.545 --> 00:00:23.467
And let's remember,

12
00:00:23.467 --> 00:00:26.845
we're talking about a country that is only 69 years old.

13
00:00:26.845 --> 00:00:30.197
Think about it, the U.S. is 240 years old

14
00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:31.426
and last time I checked

15
00:00:31.426 --> 00:00:33.907
we still are working out a few kinks.

16
00:00:33.907 --> 00:00:36.125
Most of all, I want to thank the people of Israel

17
00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:38.637
and the West Bank for their incredible hospitality,

18
00:00:38.637 --> 00:00:41.016
their humor and their coffee.

19
00:00:41.016 --> 00:00:43.607
Everywhere I went I was offered coffee

20
00:00:43.607 --> 00:00:45.568
by complete strangers.

21
00:00:45.568 --> 00:00:47.437
Actually, maybe that's the problem.

22
00:00:47.437 --> 00:00:49.096
You have several cultures and religions

23
00:00:49.096 --> 00:00:50.797
sharing a very small space

24
00:00:50.797 --> 00:00:54.117
and everyone is amped up on caffeine.

25
00:00:54.117 --> 00:00:58.284
So maybe, at the end of the day, the answer is decaf.

26
00:00:58.357 --> 00:01:01.190
(audience cheers)

